/**
 * COREI — MARKET INTELLIGENCE WORKSTATION
 *
 * PURPOSE
 * -------
 * Presents the Market Intelligence domain as an institutional
 * intelligence workstation rather than a conventional market dashboard.
 *
 * ARCHITECTURAL POSITION
 * ----------------------
 * Market Intelligence UI
 *   ↓
 * governed market observations
 *   ↓
 * observable state
 *   ↓
 * backend-authoritative intelligence
 *
 * CURRENT AUTHORITY
 * -----------------
 * Live instrument observations are sourced from the existing
 * useMarketStore market-data integration.
 *
 * IMPORTANT BOUNDARY
 * ------------------
 * This component MUST NOT fabricate:
 * - technical indicators
 * - market regime values
 * - liquidity measurements
 * - volatility measurements
 * - opportunity scores
 * - screening rankings
 * - monitoring states
 * - signals
 * - decisions
 * - TradeIntent
 *
 * Unsupported intelligence is explicitly presented as NOT EXPOSED.
 *
 * EXECUTION BOUNDARY
 * ------------------
 * This UI is read-only / analytical.
 * It has NO order-routing authority.
 * It has NO broker authority.
 * It has NO live execution authority.
 */

